{"ticker":"NI","updated":"2026-10-23T23:22:32Z","profile":{"longName":"NiSource Inc.","shortName":"NiSource Inc","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Gas","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nisource.com","fullTimeEmployees":7668,"marketCap":20755359744,"trailingPE":23.021276,"forwardPE":19.276852,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0161097,"pegRatio":2.52,"targetMeanPrice":48.09375,"targetHighPrice":52.0,"targetLowPrice":43.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.046,"earningsGrowth":-0.584,"grossMargins":0.50971,"operatingMargins":0.17156,"profitMargins":0.13153,"totalRevenue":6881500160,"beta":0.548,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":49.21,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":38.42,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.75},"summary":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.","summary_zh":"NiSource Inc. 是一家能源控股公司，在美國以受監管的天然氣和電力公司運作。它分為兩個部門：哥倫比亞營運部門和 NIPSCO 營運部門。該公司透過約 37,300 英里的分配主管道和相關的個人客戶服務線路向住宅、商業和工業客戶提供天然氣；俄亥俄州、賓夕法尼亞州、維吉尼亞州、肯塔基州和馬裡蘭州的 310 英里輸電主管。它還為印第安納州北部各縣的約 50 萬客戶發電、輸電和配電，並從事批發電力和輸電交易。它在麥田和密西根城擁有並經營動力煤發電站；西特雷霍特的聯合循環燃氣渦輪機；麥田天然氣發電機組；卡羅爾縣和懷特縣的水力發電廠；懷特縣的風力發電機組；以及沙利文縣、吉布森縣、賈斯珀縣和懷特縣的太陽能發電機組。該公司前身為 NIPSCO Industries, Inc.，並於 1999 年 4 月更名為 NiSource Inc.。 NiSource Inc. 成立於 1847 年，總部位於印第安納州梅里爾維爾。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的天然氣","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":42.63,"h":43.0,"l":42.52,"c":42.67,"v":3016700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":42.7,"h":42.7,"l":42.1,"c":42.38,"v":4133800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":42.28,"h":42.63,"l":42.26,"c":42.44,"v":2491600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":42.33,"h":42.44,"l":42.08,"c":42.14,"v":2184900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":42.21,"h":42.36,"l":42.08,"c":42.27,"v":1756600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":42.02,"h":42.39,"l":41.63,"c":42.11,"v":2361900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":41.91,"h":42.23,"l":41.62,"c":41.8,"v":2807700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":41.91,"h":41.91,"l":38.45,"c":39.83,"v":15860500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":39.48,"h":40.59,"l":39.4,"c":40.33,"v":10085200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":40.33,"h":40.52,"l":40.02,"c":40.23,"v":4587700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":40.24,"h":40.67,"l":39.99,"c":40.49,"v":2642800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":40.56,"h":40.83,"l":40.38,"c":40.73,"v":2722000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":40.72,"h":41.2,"l":40.45,"c":41.13,"v":4422500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":40.83,"h":41.2,"l":40.75,"c":41.01,"v":2379900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":41.04,"h":41.14,"l":40.54,"c":40.54,"v":4361200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":40.41,"h":40.56,"l":39.3,"c":39.37,"v":5385400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":39.58,"h":40.08,"l":39.44,"c":39.61,"v":4378200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":39.5,"h":40.31,"l":39.33,"c":40.16,"v":6090700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":40.25,"h":40.57,"l":40.1,"c":40.32,"v":5497400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":40.58,"h":41.74,"l":40.52,"c":41.3,"v":8965900