-17","zh":"NiSource (NI) 獲得 Microsoft Power 交易，因其被低估的案例面臨真正的考驗"},{"title":"Did Microsoft Power Deal Just Shift NiSource (NI) Investment Narrative?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPOU9VZk1HTjJyTTVUc0w3aDlTeHk2NnNVRGtTRnBPTGs5aFozX3BsTzVXaU9oV21nWXRDenlIX2FKX3JxaEJ2TkpMLUFTQXNIZ3pDeml1Vjc0WUhQR1BQUmpPVHVES2J5ZklFT2NDaGVRWGVvT2RXN2x5R2hQamJMM3hqZUFHVk5xOXB3bUtNdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-17","zh":"Microsoft Power 交易是否只是改變了 NiSource (NI) 的投資敘事？"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"資料中心","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"能源/電力","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1111711/000111171126000027/nix-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"NiSource Inc. is an energy holding company under the Public Utility Holding Company Act of 2005 whose primary subsidiaries are fully regulated natural gas and electric utility companies, serving approximately 3.8 million customers in six states. NiSource is the successor to an Indiana corporation organized in 1987 under the name of NIPSCO Industries, Inc., which changed its name to NiSource Inc. on April 14, 1999.","zh":"NiSource Inc. 是一家根據 2005 年公共事業控股公司法成立的能源控股公司，其主要子公司是受到全面監管的天然氣和電力公司，為六個州的約 380 萬客戶提供服務。 NiSource 是 1987 年在印第安納州成立的 NIPSCO Industries, Inc. 公司的繼承者，該公司於 1999 年 4 月 14 日更名為 NiSource Inc.。"},{"en":"NiSource's principal subsidiaries include NiSource Gas Distribution Group, Inc. (a holding company that owns Columbia of Kentucky, Columbia of Maryland, Columbia of Ohio, Columbia of Pennsylvania, and Columbia of Virginia), and NIPSCO Holdings I (a holding company that owns a controlling interest in NIPSCO, a gas and electric utility). NiSource derives substantially all of its revenues and earnings from the operating results of these rate-regulated businesses. In addition, NiSource will develop the generation resources it plans to use in serving data center customers through its subsidiary Generation Holdings I (a holding company that holds a controlling interest in GenCo).","zh":"NiSource 的主要子公司包括 NiSource Gas Distribution Group, Inc.（一家控股公司，擁有肯塔基州哥倫比亞、馬裡蘭州哥倫比亞、俄亥俄州哥倫比亞、賓夕法尼亞州哥倫比亞和維吉尼亞州哥倫比亞）和 NIPSCO Holdings I（一家擁有天然氣和電力公司 NIPSCO 控股權的控股公司）。 NiSource 的大部分收入和收益均來自這些受利率管制的企業的經營業績。此外，NiSource 將開發發電資源，計劃透過其子公司 Generation Holdings I（一家持有 GenCo 控股權的控股公司）為資料中心客戶提供服務。"},{"en":"Our business strategy focuses on providing safe and reliable service through our core, rate-regulated, asset-based utilities, with the goal of adding value to all of our stakeholders. Our utilities continue to advance our core safety, infrastructure and environmental investment programs, supported by complementary regulatory and customer initiatives across the six states in which we operate. In 2025, we entered into the ADS Contract, a customized agreement under which NIPSCO will provide electric service to ADS by procuring power from GenCo, which will develop related generation assets, and we expect our data center operations to continue to grow.","zh":"我們的業務策略著重於透過我們的核心、費率監管、基於資產的公用事業提供安全可靠的服務，目標是為所有利害關係人增加價值。在我們營運所在的六個州的補充監管和客戶措施的支持下，我們的公用事業公司繼續推進我們的核心安全、基礎設施和環境投資計畫。 2025年，我們簽訂了ADS合同，這是一份定制協議，根據該協議，NIPSCO將通過從GenCo購買電力來為ADS提供電力服務，GenCo將開發相關發電資產，我們預計我們的資料中心業務將繼續增長。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Competition. Due to open access and the deregulation of natural gas supplies, our LDC customers can purchase gas directly from producers and marketers in an open, competitive market. Certain of our subsidiaries are involved in programs that provide our residential and commercial customers the opportunity to purchase their natural gas requirements from third parties and use our subsidiaries for transportation services. As of December 31, 2025, 34.9% of our residential customers and 41.1% of our commercial customers participated in such programs.","zh":"競賽。由於天然氣供應的開放准入和放鬆管制，我們最不發達的國家客戶可以在開放、競爭的市場中直接從生產商和行銷商購買天然氣。我們的某些子公司參與了一些計劃，為我們的住宅和商業客戶提供從第三方購買天然氣需求並使用我們的子公司提供運輸服務的機會。截至2025年12月31日，我們34.9%的住宅客戶和41.1%的商業客戶參與了此類計畫。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Columbia Operations","val":3324800000,"zh":"哥倫比亞業務"},{"name":"NIPSCO Operations","val":3198000000,"zh":"NIPSCO營運"}],"total":6522800000}},"peers":["PNW","CNP","CMS","PEG","LNT"]}}